{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"第一眼落在左上方的大号标题，紫色强调词“那些气不该忍”和“过去开心的事”最醒目；随后视线容易被下方同样醒目的蓝色强调词“没了力气”“只觉得难受”吸引。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"一个人仍对过去忍下的委屈不服气，不敢多想过去开心的事；如今的具体处境第一眼不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"不服气、疲惫、难受。\",\n  \"missed\": \"已经不在那些人身边；过去的不服气逐渐淡去，最终剩下的是难受。这个情绪变化和离开那些人的处境，需要读下方整句才能明确。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上下两块大号标题都很显眼，争夺主视线。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在两块标题里：上方讲过去的不服气和不敢回想，下方讲争执耗尽力气、离开那些人后的难受，需要拼接才能理解完整关系。\",\n    \"单块标题较长，内部包含多个层次，不能只凭放大的关键词直接获得完整处境。\",\n    \"中间和下方的小字连续堆叠，补充了音乐、回忆和情绪变化等信息，但快速扫视时难以兼顾。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "31efdc47-7a28-49e6-b21c-99694308124f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T013704691207Z", "elapsed_seconds": 27.375, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:37:32.061012+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2570f0230ec6b587bba2f819871f6c7d9e0092f4efc12fc2bfa3683e292b3e45", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T013704691207Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "6042878c0e91a9bb4bd9a11be3b11695ac9bdd99de097355409bb737d9d47bc2"}}}
